【来源1】{"claim": "Dave's method for overcoming creative block is to immerse himself in things he loves, such as concerts or his favorite albums, to jumpstart inspiration.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-03T13:16:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: If I'm having trouble coming up with ideas, I usually immerse myself in something I love, like concerts or my favorite albums. Doing that usually helps to jumpstart my inspiration. Maybe try taking a break from music and explore other things. Plus, have some fun while you're at it!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "Dave dreams of someday building a custom car from scratch.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-03T13:16:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: Thanks Calvin! Appreciate the support. I'm gonna keep learning more about auto engineering, maybe even build a custom car from scratch someday - that's the dream! For now, just gonna keep working on this project and assisting customers.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "Calvin dreams of touring the world, performing for different people and connecting with them, hoping his music reaches a global audience and makes an impact.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-20T16:15:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I'm dreaming of touring the world, performing for different people and connecting with them. I hope my music can reach a global audience and make an impact. I'm also looking forward to my upcoming trip to Boston after I finish the Frank Ocean tour. I've heard that the music scene there is awesome, so I can't wait to check it out!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Calvin plans to take Dave's advice to take a break from music and explore other things.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-03T13:16:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! Taking a break is great for getting my mojo back. I'll definitely take your advice and explore. Appreciate the help! You're awesome!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Calvin learned a lot and received great advice from music industry professionals at the Tokyo festival.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-20T16:15:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: I learned a lot and got some great advice from professionals in the music industry. It was inspiring!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Calvin relaxes by taking long drives in his red sports car.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-03T13:16:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: [Image: a photo of a red sports car driving down a road] Hey Dave, long drives in [this car] really help me relax. The feeling of the wind and the open road is so freeing. It helps me clear my head. What do you like to do to chill out?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Calvin received advice from a producer to stay true to himself and sound unique.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-20T16:15:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: The producer gave me some advice to stay true to myself and sound unique. It got me thinking about where I want my music to go. It's really motivating!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Calvin is currently stuck with his music, feeling his creativity is frozen.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-03T13:16:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: Yea, I totally hear ya. Embracing nature has been really calming for me too. I've been loving getting to know Japanese culture. On the other hand, I'm stuck with my music at the moment, like my creativity's frozen or something. Any tips?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "Dave considers seeing his favorite artists perform live a dream.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-03-26T16:45:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: Nah, didn't get to hang with them after the show, but seeing them live was cool enough. It's always a dream to see your favorites performing!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "Dave offers to show Calvin around Boston and its cool spots, and says he will be in the front row when Calvin performs onstage.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-04-20T16:15:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: [Image: a photography of a city skyline with a boat in the water] Sounds like an amazing plan, Cal! I can't wait for your trip to Boston. I'll show you around town and all the cool spots. The music scene there is awesome, with places like Paradise Rock, House of Blues, and Fenway Park. You'll definitely have some great performances there. Count me in for the front row when you're up onstage! Oh, and by the way, check out this pic.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "Dave has a shop and invited Calvin to come by sometime.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-01T18:24:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: [Image: a photo of a group of people standing in front of a car] I will! By the way, This is a photo of my shop. Come by sometime, if you can!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "Dave's favorite band at the festival was Aerosmith, whose performance he found incredible.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-03-26T16:45:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: [Image: a photo of a concert with a large eagle on the stage] Wow, there were so many great bands! If I had to pick a favorite, it would definitely be Aerosmith. Their performance was incredible. I'll show you a pic I took when they were playing.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Dave: [Image: a photo of a car dealership with cars parked in front of it] Hey Calvin, long time no see! A lot's been happening since we last talked. Guess what? I finally opened my own car maintenance shop! It's so satisfying to have a spot to work on cars - it's like a dream come true! Take a look at the photo.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "raw_fallback"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-01T18:24:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: [Image: a photo of a car dealership with cars parked in front of it] Hey Calvin, long time no see! A lot's been happening since we last talked. Guess what? I finally opened my own car maintenance shop! It's so satisfying to have a spot to work on cars - it's like a dream come true! Take a look at the photo.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "Dave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "raw_fallback"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-01T18:24:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "Calvin: [Image: a photo of a book with a space theme on it] Woo, Dave! Congrats on achieving your dream - you've got guts and ambition - that's awesome! Keep it up!", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "raw_fallback"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-01T18:24:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: [Image: a photo of a book with a space theme on it] Woo, Dave! Congrats on achieving your dream - you've got guts and ambition - that's awesome! Keep it up!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "Dave says opening his own car maintenance shop was his dream and he is happy to see it getting started.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Dave", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-05-01T18:24:00+00:00", "text": "Dave: Thanks, Cal! It's great to see my hard work paying off. Opening this shop was my dream, and I'm really happy to see it getting started. It was a lot of hard work, but it was worth it.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "Calvin: Hey Dave, been a few days, so I wanted to let you in on some cool news.  I just got a new car and it's amazing! Finally owning a luxury car was a dream come true and I'm so stoked.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "raw_fallback"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Calvin", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-03-26T16:45:00+00:00", "text": "Calvin: Hey Dave, been a few days, so I wanted to let you in on some cool news.  I just got a new car and it's amazing! Finally owning a luxury car was a dream come true and I'm so stoked.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
